[en.FOCUS_GEN_INDUSTRY_INFRA_3]
New Infrastructure III

[en.FOCUS_GEN_INDUSTRY_INFRA_3_desc]
So, while we may admire their dedication to efficiency, we can’t help but wonder if this infrastructure craze is just a clever ruse to distract us from the real political shenanigans happening behind the scenes.\nOnly time will tell, my friends, as Equestria world’s infrastructure expansion gallops forward, the only question is, will we be left in the dust?

[zh.FOCUS_GEN_INDUSTRY_INFRA_3]
新基建 III

[zh.FOCUS_GEN_INDUSTRY_INFRA_3_desc]
所以，虽然我们可能钦佩他们对效率的执着，但我们不禁要问，这种基础设施狂热是否只是一种巧妙的诡计，用来转移我们对幕后真正政治阴谋的注意力。\n只有时间会给我们答案了，我的朋友们，当小马利亚世界的基础设施扩张前进时，唯一的问题是，我们会被抛在尘埃之中吗？

